❗️Satya Nadella says Microsoft is making its "BIGGEST BET YET" on its own AI chips.

Starting in 2027, Microsoft plans MULTI-GIGAWATT Maia deployments, potentially exceeding 1 MILLION chips, making them its primary AI inference system. Maia 300 promises 40% more tokens per watt than leading GPU systems.

