❗️Mark Zuckerberg tells the FT that Meta has FINALLY caught up with OpenAI and Anthropic at the AI frontier.

He's pledging more spending and still REJECTS calls to slow AI development. Meta is already building its next model, and expects development to get 'quite a bit faster from here'. Meta expects to do 'way more things' in the future, but each task could require 'somewhat fewer people'.

