❗️The Information reports, the Trump administration intends to transfer 3 top officials from the Center for Advancing Innovation and Standards for Super Intelligence (CAISSI) to the White House.

Its being done so its testers are in the room when policy on new models gets made rather than being consulted after the fact. A White House official framed it as a fix for poor coordination with Commerce.

